    {
      "type": "heading",
      "text": "The Headlines"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "MELTING AWAY . A statue of Florida governor Ron DeSantis has been unveiled in Tallahassee, Florida, which is slowly melting away to reveal a skull under the Republican governor’s face, reported The Guardian . The statue is a public protest from the environmental group 350 Action and advertising agency Uncommon, in response to DeSantis’s lack of action on the climate crisis. “The climate crisis is one of the top issues facing our planet today. And yet, some candidates running for office still deny it’s happening, and deny the bold climate action that the people want,” said Candice Fortin, campaign manager at 350 Action. The Florida governor’s time in office comes to an end in January after eight years. In 2018, he said “I am not a global warming person, I don’t want that label on me.”",
      "links": [
        {
          "text": "The Guardian",
          "url": "https://nam02.safelinks.protection.outlook.com/?url=https%3A%2F%2Fe.mail.artnews.com%2Fclick%3FZTJDBavQgFEZ9FtcjURONzur_mRZKKbNp6aKb4UZtIoym6A1ZlL57sXSg68M9h_vdL2ldIKXg_0HBHPbaeuT0SVP09EjFaKUyo7SqH4x0SnGlhslYTw_UIT3Sj-QYFGTtlAWuuVeWexMmNZlRSN_bd-XMOMohaGCCHmhp3j8x-kVebyO0v3EJ8wbFR8gNd1v9kXeSS92tDjthuxSuGPPMypqZDxUyxsoqAm6BuWtMgIG5Emus5Pnt4ZIgOyg57Je788v_s-BSNJuTvbbDoMkTFE1mwCj9Th5v-PSLvwcAet8634ef0f&data=05%7C02%7Chmohammed%40artnews.com%7C44d763821f784bc37fd508df2f72b64b%7Ce950f25546e44144a778a6ff4f557492%7C0%7C0%7C639281841880221995%7CUnknown%7CTWFpbGZsb3d8eyJFbXB0eU1hcGkiOnRydWUsIlYiOiIwLjAuMDAwMCIsIlAiOiJXaW4zMiIsIkFOIjoiTWFpbCIsIldUIjoyfQ%3D%3D%7C0%7C%7C%7C&sdata=qesndqJpzLmI98bWpo0tqGZVL%2FbMesJC9AnujPsbaIg%3D&reserved=0"
